WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.376
Where did religion come from?

2
00:00:02.376 --> 00:00:05.084
Early anthropologists gave three famous

3
00:00:05.084 --> 00:00:06.183
answers.

4
00:00:06.526 --> 00:00:08.667
Tylor said religion began with

5
00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.776
animism, belief in spirits.

6
00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:12.775
Frazer said magic came first,

7
00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:13.804
then religion,

8
00:00:13.804 --> 00:00:14.967
then science.

9
00:00:14.967 --> 00:00:17.365
Durkheim saw totemism as society

10
00:00:17.365 --> 00:00:19.276
worshipping itself.

11
00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:20.493
For Frazer,

12
00:00:20.493 --> 00:00:22.738
magic tries to compel nature.

13
00:00:22.738 --> 00:00:24.980
Religion tries to persuade higher

14
00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.003
powers.

15
00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.343
A shaman is a part-time

16
00:00:28.343 --> 00:00:29.946
healer and medium.

17
00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.727
A priest holds a full-time

18
00:00:31.727 --> 00:00:32.758
office.

19
00:00:33.096 --> 00:00:34.322
Your turn.

20
00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:36.922
Who said animism came first?
